                <h2 style="font-size:24px;font-weight:800;color:var(--md-heading);margin:0 0 18px;letter-spacing:-0.3px;">What custom build delivers (&#8377;28L&ndash;&#8377;60L Growth-tier)</h2>
                <h4>4-app suite:</h4><ul><li><strong>Customer app</strong>: hyperlocal catalogue, 10-min ETA, substitution flow, subscriptions</li><li><strong>Picker app</strong>: aisle-by-aisle picking, real-time inventory, slot management, shift rosters</li><li><strong>Rider app</strong>: route + batch optimisation, multi-order pickups, ETA accuracy, earnings + SOS</li><li><strong>Admin dashboard</strong>: dark store ops, fleet, vendor onboarding, surge, finance, fraud, multi-city</li></ul><h4>Operational backbone:</h4><ul><li>Dark store geofencing + auto store-routing</li><li>Picker dispatch ML (predict pick time + assign to fastest picker)</li><li>ETA prediction with rider availability + traffic factored</li><li>Substitution + stock-out logic with customer notification</li><li>Unit economics dashboard (AOV, contribution margin, picker efficiency, last-mile cost, dark store P&amp;L)</li><li>RBI eMandate-compliant subscriptions (milk, vegetables)</li><li>WhatsApp Business API re-engagement</li></ul>
